wer of six  and now we can read off the coefficients  to c the mystery die needs to be labeled  with three faces of zero and three faces  of six  incredible  i think this is a great interview  question because you could solve it with  the high power tools of probability  generating functions but you could also  solve it logically considering how the  mystery die needs to be labeled to get  the correct sums  thanks for watching and for making mind  your decisions one of the best channels  on youtube  thanks for watching and thanks for your  support  [Music]
 

